    "video": {
      "name": "Keto Recipe - Mini Vanilla Cloud Cakes",
      "description": "Who doesn’t love mini cakes? Especially when they’re guilt-free! These mini vanilla cloud cakes are a sweet and delicate treat for any occasion. While these are low-carb, no one would ever guess! The fluffy vanilla cream cheese frosting melts in your mouth with every bite. The addictive frosting, combined with a light cake, makes for an elegant showstopper.\n\nRead the full recipe with full nutrition breakdown and step-by-step pictures over at:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nIngredients:\nCake\n6 large eggs, separated\n6 tablespoons cream cheese, room temperature\n½ teaspoon cream of tartar\n2 tsp. vanilla extract\n¼ cup granulated stevia/erythritol mix\n\nFrosting\n16 ounces cream cheese, softened\n2 tablespoons butter, softened\n1/3 cup granulated stevia/erythritol mix\n1 tablespoon vanilla extract\n\nNutrition Summary:\nThis makes a total of 8 servings of Keto Mini Vanilla Cloud Cakes. Each cake comes out to be 323.75 Calories, 29.72g Fats, 4.46g Net Carbs, and 8.9g Protein.\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSee more keto recipes, knowledge and tips on the website to keep your weight loss going strong.\n\nEverything you need to know about the keto diet:\n\nGetting started? Everything you need is here:\n\nWe also make things easy with this 30 day diet plan:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nFollow Ruled.Me for more tasty food:",
